Mobile-first as a constraint rather than a slogan: a performance budget that failed the build,
and a flow that still worked with JavaScript half-loaded.

![Placeholder](../../src/assets/placeholder-2.jpg)

Feature flags let the new flow ship dark, then roll out gradually behind real conversion data.

